ce_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Disable_Device\" title=\"Disable Device\">Disable Device</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Search\" title=\"Search\">Search +17</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Search\" title=\"Search\">Search +17</a>:</b> Passive: +17 <a href=\"/page/Competence_bonus\" title=\"Competence bonus\">Competence bonus</a> to the <a href=\"/page/Search\" title=\"Search\">Search</a> skill.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\">Exceptional Seeker +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Seeker\" title=\"Seeker\">Exceptional Seeker +4</a>:</b> Provides a +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to confirm critical hits, and a +4 Insight bonus to critical hit damage (before multipliers are applied).</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Resistance_(enchantment)\" title=\"Resistance (enchantment)\"> Resistance +6</a>:</b> Passive: +6 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to Fortitude, Reflex, and Will Saving Throws.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Wrist Boost</a> +1 or +3:</b> +1 or +3 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Bracers_of_Twisting_Shade_(Level_23).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Bracers_of_Twisting_Shade_%28Level_23%29.png/420px-Bracers_of_Twisting_Shade_%28Level_23%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"377\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Bracers_of_Twisting_Shade_%28Level_23%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>These leather bracers will slightly dim any source of light they are brought close to.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201426\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.140 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3982/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28006/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7970/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n118.02%  142.121     52 Template:IO\n100.00%  120.417      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  120.417      1 -total\n 95.79%  115.347      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 40.21%   48.416      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.52%   47.591      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 37.96%   45.715      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 36.78%   44.292      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.53%   27.128      8 Template:Popup\n 14.44%   17.383      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:29393-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817201426 and revision id 648911. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
